{
  "file": "module5",
  "page": 58,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.4222412109375,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "However, the GDG noted that treatment duration is a critical issue which was further considered in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        350.83770751953125,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "the context of issues such as cost, acceptability and feasibility.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        102.29462432861328,
        527.6094360351562,
        116.73762512207031
      ],
      "text": "The GDG also discussed that presumably, a shorter duration of treatment would reduce costs to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.49463653564453,
        527.4508666992188,
        129.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "both the health care system and to children with TB and their families. The GDG ultimately agreed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        527.4356079101562,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "on ‘moderate savings’ despite the varying views on the level of these savings. The GDG judged that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.4168701171875,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "equity was probably increased with a shorter duration of treatment. Despite no direct evidence on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        473.78619384765625,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "acceptability, the GDG judged that the shorter regimen was acceptable to stakeholders.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        176.79859924316406,
        527.5970458984375,
        191.24159240722656
      ],
      "text": "In addition, the GDG felt that, in the absence of exposure to DR-TB, access to CXR would help",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        189.9987335205078,
        527.4287109375,
        204.4417266845703
      ],
      "text": "distinguish between non-severe and severe disease. However, the panel recognized that access to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        203.19862365722656,
        527.4389038085938,
        217.64161682128906
      ],
      "text": "CXR is often limited or quality of CXR and capacity for interpretation is insufficient at lower levels",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        216.3986358642578,
        527.4431762695312,
        230.8416290283203
      ],
      "text": "of the health care system, which may have equity implications. Therefore, feasibility was judged to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        229.59864807128906,
        527.4344482421875,
        244.04164123535156
      ],
      "text": "vary by setting. The GDG noted that it is critically important to clearly define “non-severe” disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        242.79859924316406,
        527.2924194335938,
        257.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "and that NTPs be encouraged to scale up access to quality CXR and train health care providers",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.9987335205078,
        527.1925048828125,
        270.4417419433594
      ],
      "text": "in its interpretation. Overall, the GDG judged that if the severity of TB disease in children can be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.1986083984375,
        527.0971069335938,
        283.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "adequately determined under programmatic conditions, then implementation of a 4-month regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.989044189453125,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.39862060546875,
        147.80860900878906,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "is highly feasible.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        310.1917724609375,
        293.45489501953125,
        331.07177734375
      ],
      "text": "5.1.2. Subgroup considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        337.0998229980469,
        527.4283447265625,
        351.7188415527344
      ],
      "text": "Children with peripheral lymph node TB : Although the number of children with peripheral lymph",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        350.4757995605469,
        527.5056762695312,
        364.9188232421875
      ],
      "text": "node TB in the SHINE trial were small (N=19 in the 16-week arm and N=21 in the 24-week arm), there",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.972967147827148,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        363.6758117675781,
        527.4678955078125,
        378.11883544921875
      ],
      "text": "was no difference in the proportion of unfavourable outcomes between the two arms. The SHINE trial",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979881286621094,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        376.87579345703125,
        527.4409790039062,
        391.3188171386719
      ],
      "text": "also found that 16 weeks of treatment was non-inferior compared to 24 weeks of treatment among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        390.0758056640625,
        527.4002075195312,
        404.5188293457031
      ],
      "text": "children with both peripheral lymph node disease and pulmonary disease (N=182 in the 16-week",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        403.27581787109375,
        527.4387817382812,
        417.7188415527344
      ],
      "text": "arm and N=171 in the 24-week arm). These results may provide reassurance to clinicians regarding",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        416.4757995605469,
        527.4389038085938,
        430.9188232421875
      ],
      "text": "a seemingly delayed clinical response to TB treatment, frequently seen in children with peripheral",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        429.6758117675781,
        420.4604187011719,
        444.11883544921875
      ],
      "text": "lymph node TB (where lymph nodes remain enlarged even after treatment).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.2037048339844,
        527.4436645507812,
        465.8227233886719
      ],
      "text": "Children and adolescents living with HIV infection (CALHIV):  CALHIV were eligible for enrolment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 10.984289169311523,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        464.5797119140625,
        527.4411010742188,
        479.0227355957031
      ],
      "text": "in the SHINE trial; 65 (11%) CALHIV were enrolled in the 16-week arm and 62 (10%) in the 24-week",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        477.7796936035156,
        527.4769287109375,
        492.22271728515625
      ],
      "text": "arm. 49% of CALHIV in the 16-week arm and 43% in the 24-week arm were on antiretroviral treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966048240661621,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        490.9797058105469,
        527.403076171875,
        505.4227294921875
      ],
      "text": "at the time of enrolment. 20% of CALHIV in both arms had a CD4 count of less than 200 cells per mm .  3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966097831726074,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        504.1796875,
        527.40380859375,
        518.6226806640625
      ],
      "text": "51% of CALHIV in the 16-week arm and 63% in the 24-week arm were classified as severe as per the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        514.585693359375,
        527.410888671875,
        531.8226928710938
      ],
      "text": "(59) WHO immunological classification for established HIV infection  . In this subgroup, the 16-week",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        530.5797119140625,
        527.2970581054688,
        545.022705078125
      ],
      "text": "regimen was non-inferior as compared to the 24-week regimen, although the 95% confidence interval",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.961081504821777,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        543.7796630859375,
        405.4345703125,
        558.22265625
      ],
      "text": "for the risk difference was wide (risk difference -4.3, 95% CI -14.9 to 6.2).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        565.4837036132812,
        527.4290161132812,
        579.9266967773438
      ],
      "text": "In view of the limited evidence, clinicians may consider treating CALHIV with non-severe TB for 4",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        578.68359375,
        527.43115234375,
        593.1265869140625
      ],
      "text": "months, depending on the degree of immunosuppression and ART status, as well as the presence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        591.8837280273438,
        527.4334106445312,
        606.3267211914062
      ],
      "text": "of other opportunistic infections. These children and adolescents will need to be monitored closely,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        605.083740234375,
        527.3191528320312,
        619.5267333984375
      ],
      "text": "especially at 4 months of treatment, and treatment extended to 6 months if there is insufficient",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        618.2835693359375,
        115.72749328613281,
        632.7265625
      ],
      "text": "progress.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        639.8116455078125,
        527.2581176757812,
        654.4306030273438
      ],
      "text": "Children with SAM:  In the SHINE trial, SAM was defined as weight-for-height Z-score (WHZ) <−3 or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 10.99484920501709,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        650.3936157226562,
        527.4321899414062,
        667.630615234375
      ],
      "text": "(60) MUAC <115 mm  . Thirty children with SAM (5%) were included in the 16-week arm and 33 (5%)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        666.3875732421875,
        527.4269409179688,
        680.83056640625
      ],
      "text": "in the 24-week arm. No separate subgroup analysis was therefore conducted for children with SAM.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        688.0914916992188,
        527.526123046875,
        702.5344848632812
      ],
      "text": "In view of the insufficient evidence on this subgroup, and as SAM is defined as a danger sign, children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.986041069030762,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        701.2916259765625,
        448.01226806640625,
        715.734619140625
      ],
      "text": "with SAM and non-severe TB should preferably receive 6 months of TB treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        722.8195190429688,
        527.3966674804688,
        737.4384765625
      ],
      "text": "Infants <3 months of age and/or weighing <3 kg:  Infants <3 months of age and infants weighing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        736.1954956054688,
        527.3784790039062,
        750.6384887695312
      ],
      "text": "<3 kg (including premature birth (<37 weeks) were not eligible for inclusion in the SHINE trial. No",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        749.3953857421875,
        527.53759765625,
        763.83837890625
      ],
      "text": "new data on the treatment of congenital TB and very young infants (aged 0–3 months) with TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23320007324219,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "34 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        170.06539916992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        450.3536071777344,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis, Module 5: Management of tuberculosis in children and adolescents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}